#: ../../guide/handlers.rst:3
msgid "Handlers"
msgstr ""

#: ../../guide/handlers.rst:5
msgid "A handler is the code that runs when an update passes all filters of one observer. Handlers are plain ``async`` callables registered on an observer with either the decorator or the ``register`` form (see :doc:`router`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../guide/handlers.rst:17
msgid "Argument injection"
msgstr ""

#: ../../guide/handlers.rst:19
msgid "Handlers do not receive a fixed positional list — aiorubi inspects the signature and passes only the names the handler declares, drawn from the update context. Declare exactly what you need:"
msgstr ""

